   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "Everything measured on this lab: k3s v1.31.5 in k3d on OrbStack, Istio 1.24.2 ambient. Purple: control plane. Orange: storage. Green: kernel networking. Blue: proxies. Red: security decisions. Yellow: outside the cluster.",
